  "abstract_summary": "Autonomous vehicles need fast, reliable perception to detect vehicles, pedestrians, cyclists, traffic signs, and other road objects in real time. This paper surveys camera-based one-stage object detectors for autonomous driving. It traces 24 one-stage detectors, from YOLOv1 (2016) through SSD, RetinaNet, anchor-free...",
